  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 1dc66e9658df9284f81f0664a7ee2889, type: 3}
  m_Name: Reed+DarryMediationCollectible
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::CollectableEntries
  entryTitle: A Note from Darry (Mediation)
  description: 
  neutralDescription: "I\u2019m a bit upset that Reed can\u2019t find it in himself
    to forgive me just yet, but I\u2019m glad he heard me out. I made a big mistake,
    to be sure, but I also think he took it too far at times. I\u2019m looking forward
    to watching the game later after giving each other some space."
  negativeDescription: "What the f*#& is Reed\u2019s problem? Did he just blow up
    our friendship of years over this?! I get it, I made a mistake, but I would\u2019ve
    been able to explain everything had he just listened!"
  positiveDescription: "I can\u2019t believe how tense that got. I\u2019m such an
    idiot, I should\u2019ve just woken Reed up to tell him what I was doing, or sent
    him a message, something! I\u2019ve got to stop trying to hide things. Thankfully,
    things went well and we were able to resolve it somewhat peacefully. Now, to
    cool off\u2026"
